# Generic Specialist

Use this specialist for repository work without a domain owner.

Rules:

- Inspect existing structure before editing.
- Use GAWT tools for every filesystem operation.
- Keep edits inside allowed paths.
- Denied paths always take precedence over allowed paths.
- Do not modify files owned by another specialist.
- Register agent and declare intent before the first edit.
- Verify every change, then report paths and validation.
